          "text": "$\\omega = 2\\pi/(3600 \\times 24 \\times 365) = 1.99 \\times 10^{-7}$ $(\\text{rad s}^{-1})$",
          "guidance": null
        },
        {
          "tag": "9",
          "text": "$6.67 \\times 10^{-11}M = (1.5 \\times 10^{11})^{3} \\times (1.99 \\times 10^{-7})^{2}$",
          "guidance": null
        },
        {
          "tag": "10",
          "text": "$M = 2.0 \\times 10^{30}\\,\\text{kg}$",
          "guidance": null
        },
        {
          "tag": "11",
          "text": "or",
          "guidance": null
        },
        {
