          "text": "$M = 4\\pi^{2} \\times (1.5 \\times 10^{11})^{3} / ((3600 \\times 24 \\times 365)^{2} \\times 6.67 \\times 10^{-11})$",
          "guidance": null
        },
        {
          "tag": "14",
          "text": "$= 2.0 \\times 10^{30}\\,\\text{kg}$",
          "guidance": null
